<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>company results expected this week include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-----------PVS</p>
<p>THURSDAY, May 1</p>
<p>Shell T&amp;T Plc    ***1Q PFT     1,510.0  1,355.0-1,736.0 1,510.0</p>
<p>FRIDAY, May 2</p>
<p>Unilever Plc	  1Q PFT	 554.0    530.0-585.0     509.0</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>* Forecasts are before exceptional items.</p>
<p>** Forecasts do not include 50 million stg pre-tax profit from the sale of First Federal Savings and Loan Association by a subsidiary of Imasco.</p>
<p>*** Forecasts are on a current cost basis before exceptional items.</p>
</text>
